<footer>
  Rankings compiled from consensus half‑PPR draft boards, expert rankings, and kicker/defense projections current as of late August 2026 (FantasyPros ECR, RotoBaller, Football Nation, Yahoo Sports, PFN, STACKED, PFF). This is a snapshot, not a live feed — re-run this build closer to your draft for the latest camp/injury news. Passing yardage is assumed at the standard 25 yds/pt since your league rules didn't specify it; adjust your own value read for QBs if that differs. Schedule notes are only shown where a real source called out something specific — most teams don't have a public per-position SOS figure available without a premium subscription, so absence of a note isn't a knock on the matchup.
  <br><br>Your stars and notes are saved to your account and will be here next time you open this.
</footer>

